. Always use start \"ready\".\n\nSchema:\n  {\"name\": slug, \"space\": \"joint\", \"start\": \"ready\",\n    \"keyframes\": [{\"t\": seconds, \"q\": [6 rad], \"grip\": 0..1, \"ease\": \"cubic\"|\"linear\"|\"hold\"}, ...],\n    \"loop\": 1..10, \"speed\": 0.1..2 (playback time = t / speed), \"notes\": one sentence}\nRules:\n  - First keyframe at t=0 and equal to the ready pose [0.0, 0.5, 0.8, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0]; end back at ready.\n  - t strictly increasing. Total playback (t_last / speed * loop) <= 60 s; aim for 5-15 s.\n  - ease applies to the segment ending at that keyframe. Prefer \"cubic\" (smooth stop at each keyframe).\n    \"linear\" starts/stops with a velocity jump and will fail the acceleration cap. \"hold\" = pause; its q\n    must equal the previous keyframe's q.\n  - If loop > 1 the last keyframe must equal the first.\n  - Keep motions modest: stay at least 0.2 rad inside every soft limit; j2 in [0.4, 1.2] and\n    j3 in [0.6, 1.6] are comfortable. Expressive motion comes from j1, j4, j5, j6 and the gripper.\n\nExample playables (valid):\nwave: {\"name\":\"wave\",\"space\":\"joint\",\"start\":\"ready\",\"keyframes\":[{\"t\":0,\"q\":[0.0,0.5,0.8,0.0,0.0,0.0],\"grip\":0.0,\"ease\":\"cubic\"},{\"t\":1.65,\"q\":[0.0,0.7,1.1,-0.3,0.0,0.0],\"ease\":\"cubic\"},{\"t\":2.6,\"q\":[0.08,0.7,1.1,-0.3,0,0.12],\"ease\":\"cubic\"},{\"t\":3.9,\"q\":[-0.08,0.7,1.1,-0.3,0,-0.12],\"ease\":\"cubic\"},{\"t\":5.2,\"q\":[0.08,0.7,1.1,-0.3,0,0.12],\"ease\":\"cubic\"},{\"t\":6.5,\"q\":[-0.08,0.7,1.1,-0.3,0,-0.12],\"ease\":\"cubic\"},{\"t\":7.8,\"q\":[0.08,0.7,1.1,-0.3,0,0.12],\"ease\":\"cubic\"},{\"t\":9.1,\"q\":[-0.08,0.7,1.1,-0.3,0,-0.12],\"ease\":\"cubic\"},{\"t\":10.05,\"q\":[0.0,0.7,1.1,-0.3,0.0,0.0],\"ease\":\"cubic\"},{\"t\":11.7,\"q\":[0.0,0.5,0.8,0.0,0.0,0.0],\"ease\":\"cubic\"}],\"loop\":1,\"speed\":1.0}\nnod: {\"name\":\"nod\",\"space\":\"joint\",\"start\":\"ready\",\"keyframes\":[{\"t\":0,\"q\":[0.0,0.5,0.8,0.0,0.0,0.0],\"grip\":0.0,\"ease\":\"cubic\"},{\"t\":0.85,\"q\